{"seq":2,"slug":"lending-borrowing","title":"借贷协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/lending-borrowing","wordCount":2645,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"借贷协议\">借贷协议</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>DeFi 借贷是把银行存贷业务搬到智能合约上执行：存款人向流动性池提供资产，借款人超额抵押后借出资产，利率由算法根据资金供需实时决定。理解它的关键是<strong>超额抵押机制</strong>与<strong>清算机制</strong>的联动。</p>\n<p><strong>定义与要素</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>流动性池（Pool）</strong>：所有存款与借款共用的资金池，存款与借款的利率由池内<strong>利用率</strong>驱动。</li>\n<li><strong>超额抵押</strong>：DeFi 借贷无信用评估，因此要求抵押品价值始终高于借款价值，用代码替代信任。</li>\n<li><strong>LTV 与清算阈值</strong>：LTV 是最大借款比例（如 75%）；清算阈值（如 82.5%）是触发清算的更高比例，两者之间的缓冲保护存款人。</li>\n<li><strong>健康因子（Health Factor）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>抵押品价值</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>清算阈值</mtext></mrow><mtext>借款价值</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HF} = \\frac{\\text{抵押品价值} \\times \\text{清算阈值}}{\\text{借款价值}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">借款价值</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">抵押品价值</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">清算阈值</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，HF&lt;1 即可被任何人清算。</li>\n<li><strong>利用率与利率曲线</strong>：利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> = 总借款/总存款；分段线性利率在「最优利用率」处拐点上行，用惩罚性利率激励还款。</li>\n<li><strong>清算人（Liquidator）</strong>：代偿债务、获取折价抵押品的套利者，是系统的安全阀。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>四类参与者的动机</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>收益来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存款人</td>\n<td>存入资产</td>\n<td>存款利息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>借款人</td>\n<td>超额抵押借出</td>\n<td>做多/做空、杠杆、流动性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算人</td>\n<td>清算健康因子不足仓位</td>\n<td>清算折扣（5-10%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>设定参数、收费</td>\n<td>存借利差 + 清算费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>「DeFi 借贷是信用借贷」</strong>——恰恰相反，它是<strong>超额抵押</strong>借贷，不存在无抵押信用敞口（闪电贷除外）。</li>\n<li><strong>「利率固定」</strong>——利率随利用率实时浮动，利用率从 80% 升到 90% 可能使借款利率从 4% 跳到 34%。</li>\n<li><strong>「存进去随时能取」</strong>——当利用率接近 100% 时存款可能无法提取；利用率长期 &gt;90% 是存款人的预警信号。</li>\n<li><strong>「高杠杆只放大收益」</strong>——循环借贷会同时放大利率风险、清算风险与协议风险，利差一旦反转净收益立即变负。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"defi-借贷的基本机制\">DeFi 借贷的基本机制</h2><p>去中心化借贷协议允许用户在无需信任中介的情况下进行加密资产的存款和借款。与传统银行不同，DeFi 借贷完全由智能合约驱动，利率由算法根据供需动态决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心参与者\">核心参与者</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>动机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存款人（Lender）</td>\n<td>存入资产至流动池</td>\n<td>获取存款利息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>借款人（Borrower）</td>\n<td>超额抵押后借出资产</td>\n<td>做多/做空、杠杆、流动性需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算人（Liquidator）</td>\n<td>清算健康因子不足的仓位</td>\n<td>获取清算折扣（通常 5-10%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议（Protocol）</td>\n<td>设定参数、收取费用</td>\n<td>协议收入（存借利差 + 清算费）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"超额抵押模型\">超额抵押模型</h3><p>DeFi 借贷的核心约束：<strong>所有借款必须超额抵押</strong>。这意味着借款人存入的抵押品价值必须始终高于借款价值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected end of input in a macro argument, expected &#x27;}&#x27; at end of input: …率（通常 110-150%）}\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{抵押率} = \\frac{\\text{抵押品价值}}{\\text{借款价值}} &gt; \\text{最低抵押率（通常 110-150%）}</span></div><p><strong>示例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存入 1 ETH（价值 $2,000）作为抵押</li>\n<li>最大借款额度（LTV 75%）= $1,500 等值的 USDC</li>\n<li>清算阈值（Liquidation Threshold）= 82.5%</li>\n<li>当 ETH 跌至使抵押率降至 82.5% 时触发清算</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"主要借贷协议对比\">主要借贷协议对比</h2><h3 id=\"aave\">Aave</h3><p>Aave 是最大的多链借贷协议，支持以太坊、Polygon、Arbitrum、Optimism 等多链部署：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>详情</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TVL</td>\n<td>~150 亿美元（2026年初）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持资产</td>\n<td>100+ 种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利率模型</td>\n<td>分段线性利率（Kinked Rate）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理</td>\n<td>AAVE 代币，通过 Aave DAO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闪电贷</td>\n<td>支持（单交易内无抵押借款）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创新</td>\n<td>GHO 稳定币、信用委托</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"compound\">Compound</h3><p>Compound 是 DeFi 借贷的先驱，设计简洁：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>详情</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TVL</td>\n<td>~50 亿美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本</td>\n<td>Compound V3（Comet）单资产市场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利率模型</td>\n<td>分段利率曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特点</td>\n<td>V3 采用「Base Asset」模型——每个市场只借一种资产</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"morpho\">Morpho</h3><p>Morpho 代表了新一代借贷协议的设计思路——<strong>点对点匹配优化</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>详情</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TVL</td>\n<td>~30 亿美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创新</td>\n<td>在 Aave/Compound 之上做点对点利率优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td>将存款人和借款人直接匹配，消除利差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果</td>\n<td>存款人获得更高利率，借款人支付更低利率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[DeFi借贷协议演进] --&gt; B[Compound V1: 2018]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Aave V1: 2020]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Compound V3: 2022]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Aave V3: 2023]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Morpho Blue: 2024]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;2025-2026: 模块化借贷&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[DeFi借贷协议演进] --&gt; B[Compound V1: 2018]\n    B --&gt; C[Aave V1: 2020]\n    C --&gt; D[Compound V3: 2022]\n    D --&gt; E[Aave V3: 2023]\n    E --&gt; F[Morpho Blue: 2024]\n    F --&gt; G[\"2025-2026: 模块化借贷\"]\n</pre><h2 id=\"利率模型详解\">利率模型详解</h2><h3 id=\"分段线性利率-kinked-rate-model\">分段线性利率（Kinked Rate Model）</h3><p>Aave 和 Compound 使用的核心利率模型——以「最优利用率」为拐点的分段函数：</p>\n<p><strong>利用率 &lt; 最优利用率（通常 80%）</strong>： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{borrow} = R_{base} + \\frac{U}{U_{optimal}} \\times R_{slope1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>利用率 &gt; 最优利用率</strong>： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{borrow} = R_{base} + R_{slope1} + \\frac{U - U_{optimal}}{1 - U_{optimal}} \\times R_{slope2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> = 利用率 = 总借款 / 总存款</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 基础利率（通常 0-2%）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{slope1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 低利用率斜率（温和上升）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{slope2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 高利用率斜率（急剧上升，惩罚性）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"典型参数-以-usdc-为例\">典型参数（以 USDC 为例）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最优利用率</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>超过此值利率急升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Base Rate</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>利用率为 0 时的利率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slope 1</td>\n<td>4%</td>\n<td>0-80% 区间的利率变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slope 2</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n<td>80-100% 区间的利率变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>利用率 50% → 借款利率 ≈ 2.5%</li>\n<li>利用率 80% → 借款利率 ≈ 4%</li>\n<li>利用率 90% → 借款利率 ≈ 34%（急剧惩罚）</li>\n<li>利用率 95% → 借款利率 ≈ 49%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>设计意图</strong>：通过惩罚性高利率激励借款人还款，确保存款人始终能提取资金。</p>\n<h2 id=\"清算机制与风险\">清算机制与风险</h2><h3 id=\"清算触发条件\">清算触发条件</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Health Factor</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>抵押品价值</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>清算阈值</mtext></mrow><mtext>借款价值</mtext></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Health Factor} = \\frac{\\text{抵押品价值} \\times \\text{清算阈值}}{\\text{借款价值}} &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Health Factor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">借款价值</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">抵押品价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">清算阈值</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Health Factor 降至 1 以下时，任何人都可以代偿部分债务并获取折价抵押品。</p>\n<h3 id=\"清算的连锁效应\">清算的连锁效应</h3><p>极端市场下的清算级联是 DeFi 最大的系统性风险：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>价格大幅下跌</li>\n<li>大量仓位 Health Factor &lt; 1</li>\n<li>清算人抛售获得的抵押品</li>\n<li>进一步打压价格</li>\n<li>更多仓位被清算</li>\n<li>形成正反馈死亡螺旋</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>历史案例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2022 年 LUNA 崩盘：引发超过 20 亿美元的连锁清算</li>\n<li>2022 年 stETH 脱锚：三箭资本 (3AC) 的杠杆仓位被清算</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"清算保护策略\">清算保护策略</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>保持低 LTV</strong>：借款不超过最大额度的 50%（即使协议允许 75%）</li>\n<li><strong>使用稳定资产借贷</strong>：抵押 ETH 借 USDC，而非抵押波动资产借波动资产</li>\n<li><strong>设置价格警报</strong>：当 Health Factor 降至 1.5 时收到通知</li>\n<li><strong>准备追加抵押品</strong>：保持流动性资金用于紧急追加</li>\n<li><strong>分散协议风险</strong>：不在单一协议中集中所有借贷仓位</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"循环借贷放大收益\">循环借贷放大收益</h2><h3 id=\"策略原理\">策略原理</h3><p>循环借贷（Recursive Borrowing / Looping）是通过反复存入-借出-再存入来放大敞口和收益的策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;第1步: 存入 1000 USDC&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;借出 750 USDC (LTV 75%)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;第2步: 再存入 750 USDC&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;借出 562 USDC (LTV 75%)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;第3步: 再存入 562 USDC&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;...循环&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;有效敞口: ~4000 USDC&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;有效杠杆: ~4x&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[\"第1步: 存入 1000 USDC\"] --&gt; B[\"借出 750 USDC (LTV 75%)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"第2步: 再存入 750 USDC\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"借出 562 USDC (LTV 75%)\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"第3步: 再存入 562 USDC\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"...循环\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"有效敞口: ~4000 USDC\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"有效杠杆: ~4x\"]\n</pre><h3 id=\"收益数学\">收益数学</h3><p>假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存款 APY = 5%</li>\n<li>借款 APY = 3%</li>\n<li>LTV = 75%</li>\n<li>循环 n 次</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有效存款量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{eff} = D \\times \\frac{1}{1 - LTV} = D \\times 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>（极限值）</p>\n<p>净收益率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>存款利率</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>借款利率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>杠杆倍数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(存款利率 - 借款利率 \\times LTV) \\times 杠杆倍数</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">存款利率</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">借款利率</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">杠杆倍数</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>= <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(5\\% - 3\\% \\times 75\\%) \\times 4 = (5\\% - 2.25\\%) \\times 4 = 11\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11%</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>看起来诱人，但风险极高</strong>：</p>\n<h3 id=\"循环借贷的风险\">循环借贷的风险</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>利率风险</strong>：借款利率可能突然飙升（利用率达到拐点），净收益变负</li>\n<li><strong>清算风险</strong>：高杠杆意味着极小的价格波动就可能触发清算</li>\n<li><strong>协议风险</strong>：智能合约漏洞在高杠杆下损失被放大</li>\n<li><strong>Gas 费吞噬</strong>：维护多层循环需要频繁的链上操作</li>\n<li><strong>退出流动性</strong>：极端情况下利用率达 100%，无法提取存款</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：仅适合使用稳定币对（如存 USDC 借 USDT，无价格风险）且利差稳定的情况。不建议对波动资产使用循环借贷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信用风险评估\">信用风险评估</h2><h3 id=\"协议层信用风险\">协议层信用风险</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>坏账风险</td>\n<td>预言机延迟导致清算不及时</td>\n<td>Aave 2022年CRV事件：$170万坏账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理攻击</td>\n<td>恶意提案改变协议参数</td>\n<td>Compound 2024年意外发放COMP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预言机操纵</td>\n<td>人为操纵价格触发异常清算</td>\n<td>Mango Markets 2022：$1.14亿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合约升级风险</td>\n<td>升级引入新漏洞</td>\n<td>Euler Finance 2023：$1.97亿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"评估借贷协议安全性的清单\">评估借贷协议安全性的清单</h3><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 协议是否经过多家审计公司审计？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> TVL 规模和运行时间（越大越久 = 经受更多考验）</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 是否有漏洞赏金计划（Bug Bounty）？额度多大？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 治理权力是否过度集中（多签、时间锁）？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 预言机来源（Chainlink 为首选，自建预言机风险高）？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 是否有坏账保险基金？规模是否足够？</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 代码是否开源？是否可验证？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实操建议\">实操建议</h2><h3 id=\"存款端-赚取利息\">存款端（赚取利息）</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>首选蓝筹协议</strong>：Aave V3、Compound V3 在安全性和流动性上最优</li>\n<li><strong>分散存款</strong>：不要将所有资金存入单一协议</li>\n<li><strong>关注真实利率</strong>：稳定币存款利率在 2-8% 区间波动，牛市更高</li>\n<li><strong>注意利用率</strong>：如果利用率长期 &gt;90%，存款人可能面临取款延迟</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"借款端-使用杠杆\">借款端（使用杠杆）</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>保守 LTV</strong>：不超过最大 LTV 的 50-60%</li>\n<li><strong>同类资产借贷</strong>：抵押 stETH 借 ETH（价格高度相关，清算风险极低）</li>\n<li><strong>监控 Health Factor</strong>：设置 1.5 以下的自动提醒</li>\n<li><strong>有明确还款计划</strong>：不要「借了就忘」，利息会持续累积</li>\n<li><strong>考虑 Morpho 优化</strong>：可获得比直接使用 Aave 更优的利率</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DeFi 借贷的根基是<strong>超额抵押</strong>：无信用评估，用抵押品价值覆盖借款作为信任替代，表现为 LTV、清算阈值与健康因子三层约束。</li>\n<li>利率由<strong>利用率</strong>驱动，采用分段线性模型——利用率越过最优拐点（约 80%）后利率急剧上升，用惩罚性利率激励还款并保护存款人流动性。</li>\n<li><strong>清算级联</strong>是 DeFi 最大的系统性风险：价格下跌 → 清算 → 抛售 → 进一步下跌的正反馈，2022 年 LUNA 与 stETH 脱锚都是典型案例。</li>\n<li><strong>循环借贷</strong>用反复存借放大敞口，示例中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>LTV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{eff} = D/(1-\\text{LTV})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LTV</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、约 4 倍杠杆可把 5%-3% 的利差放大到约 11% 净收益，但利率反转、清算、协议与退出流动性风险同时放大。</li>\n<li>实操纪律：保守 LTV（不超过上限的 50-60%）、同类资产借贷降低清算风险、监控健康因子（1.5 以下预警）、首选蓝筹协议并分散。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"借贷协议","id":"借贷协议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DeFi 借贷的基本机制","id":"defi-借贷的基本机制"},{"level":3,"text":"核心参与者","id":"核心参与者"},{"level":3,"text":"超额抵押模型","id":"超额抵押模型"},{"level":2,"text":"主要借贷协议对比","id":"主要借贷协议对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Aave","id":"aave"},{"level":3,"text":"Compound","id":"compound"},{"level":3,"text":"Morpho","id":"morpho"},{"level":2,"text":"利率模型详解","id":"利率模型详解"},{"level":3,"text":"分段线性利率（Kinked Rate Model）","id":"分段线性利率-kinked-rate-model"},{"level":3,"text":"典型参数（以 USDC 为例）","id":"典型参数-以-usdc-为例"},{"level":2,"text":"清算机制与风险","id":"清算机制与风险"},{"level":3,"text":"清算触发条件","id":"清算触发条件"},{"level":3,"text":"清算的连锁效应","id":"清算的连锁效应"},{"level":3,"text":"清算保护策略","id":"清算保护策略"},{"level":2,"text":"循环借贷放大收益","id":"循环借贷放大收益"},{"level":3,"text":"策略原理","id":"策略原理"},{"level":3,"text":"收益数学","id":"收益数学"},{"level":3,"text":"循环借贷的风险","id":"循环借贷的风险"},{"level":2,"text":"信用风险评估","id":"信用风险评估"},{"level":3,"text":"协议层信用风险","id":"协议层信用风险"},{"level":3,"text":"评估借贷协议安全性的清单","id":"评估借贷协议安全性的清单"},{"level":2,"text":"实操建议","id":"实操建议"},{"level":3,"text":"存款端（赚取利息）","id":"存款端-赚取利息"},{"level":3,"text":"借款端（使用杠杆）","id":"借款端-使用杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"质押与流动性质押","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/staking-liquid-staking"},"next":{"title":"流动性挖矿与风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/yield-farming-risks"}}